@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001/api
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Browse schools
GET {{baseUrl}}/schools?search=technology&maxTuition=70000&sort=rating

### Register - copy the development verificationCode from the response
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!",
  "fullName": "Sample Student"
}

### Verify email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "code": "paste-code-here"
}

### Login - copy accessToken and refreshToken to the variables above
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

### Get assessment questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/questions

### Submit assessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "interests", "optionId": "technology" },
    { "questionId": "strength", "optionId": "logic" },
    { "questionId": "environment", "optionId": "lab" },
    { "questionId": "subject", "optionId": "math" },
    { "questionId": "goal", "optionId": "innovation" }
  ]
}

### Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
